===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|τυρός||cheese|tr=turos|lang=grc}} + [[-phile]].

Modern coinage; attested since 1930s.
Popularized by [[w:Clifton Fadiman|Clifton Fadiman]] on American TV quiz show ''[[w:Information Please|Information Please]]'' in 1952.<ref>[http://www.practicallyedible.com/edible.nsf/pages/turophile turophile] on Practically Edible</ref>

